  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the segment is <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> as shown in the figure<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0081_91bd440fb005.png\" style=\"width:2.1in;height:1.33333in\" /><br />Let <math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> mid-point <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6,8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />on solving <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1,2</mn></mfenced></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math> <math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>11,14</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>244</mn></math></p>"
